    "behaviors": [
      {
        "id": "B001",
        "text": "`validate` accepts a Python schema dict (not a URL) and an instance that matches an OAS 3.0 string schema, including `nullable: true` which allows `None`."
      },
      {
        "id": "B002",
        "text": "With `cls=OAS30Validator`, an instance whose type is not allowed by the schema raises `jsonschema.exceptions.ValidationError`."
      },
      {
        "id": "B003",
        "text": "An OAS 3.0 `oneOf` schema with a `discriminator.propertyName` and local `#/components/schemas/...` mapping validates the matching variant from an in-memory schema dict."
      },
      {
        "id": "B004",
        "text": "A discriminator-selected variant that is missing a required property raises `jsonschema.exceptions.ValidationError`."
      },
      {
        "id": "B005",
        "text": "The package exposes `validate` and `OAS30Validator` with the callable paths listed in this contract."
      },
      {
        "id": "B006",
        "text": "The submitted package source does not import the forbidden upstream package `openapi_schema_validator`."
      }
